<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Zami Châ Paphaopa</book>
  <para style="h">Zami Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zami Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zami Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <para style="mt">Zami Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khazohpa nata Abeipa Zisu Krista chakaotuhpa Zâmie ta chi hrawh hleino paipatlapazy ei châ naoh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Unawh saih u, kao to liata pasiana namâ tyh tita alyna ta rao khai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namâ ngiapâna pasiana ta tiamana a tao tahpa nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khâpa hmah phahla leipa ta, pitlohna lâ pangai u la, phapakipa nama châ thei nawpa ta, tiamana chata a rai patlô mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama hry liata ahy rai sona â phahla khiahta cha, Khazohpa lâ hiah mawh sy. Khazohpa cha chyhsa zydua hnohta riaphapa nata maochhie leipa ta sona a pietuhpa châ ta, sona a phahlapa hnohta sona piepa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Châhrasala alôhleina hnei leipa ta, ngiapâna ta hiah mawh sy. A lôh leipa chyhsa cha tilaipi chatlaopa hawhta châ ta, thlih ta phao ta, a pathluahpa hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cha hawhpa chyhsa cha khâpa hmah Abeipa tawhta hmô awpa a pangiasa khah sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ano cha palôh miano a hneipa, a hmotaopa zydua liata a i leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unawh areisipa cha cheihchalopa a châ tita, a ly mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hneirôhpa chhao, sibie paw hawhta a lo awpa châ ta, chavâta panawhpa a châ tita a ly mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noh vaw chhi ta, thata palo ta, sibiepa cha uah ta, a paw zô ta, â ngiana a lei tyh. Cha hawhna chata chyhsa hneirôhpa chhao, hneirôna a tluana lâpi liata a uah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasiana liata â ipa ta a duahpa cha a nohlao na. Pasiana a pahnie tita, Khazohpa ta ano kyh a pachâtuhpazy hnohta bie â taihpa hrona lakho a to aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahy hmahta reipasaona â tyh tita, “Khazohpa ta eina reipasao,” tah khah sy. Khazohpa cha moleina ta reipasao thei rimâ awpa châ leipa ta, ano chhao ta ahy hmah reipasao beih vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chyhsa to aohraohna lâta sydiepa nata a chhipa ama châ tita, reipasaona amâ tyh tyhpa tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aohraohna ta saw phaoh ta, moleina sa ta, moleina cha a vaw pitloh nahta, thina a tlôkhei tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Unawh kho ngaitapa saih u, dôveipa ta y khah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmosaipiepa phapa nata hmosaipiepa pakipa zydua cha chô lâ tawhta a zupa châ ta, khaihpazy Paw tawhta a zupa a châ. Ano liata ananona nata nohpahlipa y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmotaopazy hry liata hmia a sahpa eima châ thei nawpa ta, ano khozie hawhta biehmeiseihpa liata a sapa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Unawh kho ngaitapa saih u, he he pahno teh u. Chyhsa to ta bie rei a chhu leipa ta, nathlie tlao a chhu ei sala, hiehâh rupa châ mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chyhsapa hiehâhna ta Khazohpa siana palâsa vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chavâta apuapa zydua nata moleina to pahlei khai u la, nama thlahpa a pachha theipa, bie chi tupa cha a reisi ngaitapa ta a pyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nâmosasyh ta a dôveipa ta, bie nathlietuhpa dei châ leipa ta, bie zyhtuhpa tlao châ muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahy rai bie thei ta, a tao tlôh vei khiahta cha, thlalâ liata a pikheipa hmia a mohpakiapa chyhsa hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pakhâta ta a moh ta, sie ta, kheihawhpa chyhsa ma a châ tahpa thlai a my ha tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khotalaina ryhpa pakipa cha moh ta, cha hawhta hroh ta, ryhpa cha thei ta, thlai a mypa châ leipa ta, zyh ta, ryhpa hawhta a taopa chyhsa cha, a hmotaopa liata thlaochhipa ta a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahy rai zyhna pachâ kawpa hawhta â pachâ ta, a paleih a vaih tlôh leipa cha, anosasyh ta â dôveipa châ ta, cha hawhpa zyhna cha phahnaina hnei leipa zyhna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khazohpa nata Paw mohmô liata zyhna pathaihpa nata papuapalei leipa cha, Hâra nata nôhmeizy ama riethei pasataona liata deichhypa nata khizaw puapa kia leipa ta ypa he a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, eima Beipa Zisu Krista, rônahna Beipa ngiapâtuhpa nama châpa hawhta, khokhei viapa hnei khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Namâ pakhyna o liata ngôh kusadizy a kypa nata chysia phapa a tobipa chyhsa a vaw ngia ta, chysia chhiepa a tobipa dyhchhiepa a vaw ngia hra ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chysia phapa a tobipa cha pachâ peimawh viapa ta, a hnohta, “Atyuna phapa liana he a tyuh mah y,” tah ei chi ta, dyhchhiepa hnohta, “Hao liata a kei duah teh,” tlyma, “Ei phei thaby siphiah liata a tyuh teh,” tlyma nama tah khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nâmo nata nâmo a pathluapa châ ei chi ta, palôh moleipa a phaohpa pachiatuhpazy châ aw veih ei chi mâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Unawh kho ngaitapa saih u, pachâ tua u! Khizaw pachâ ta dyhchhiepazy cha, ngiapâna liata hneirôh awpa nata ano kyh pachâtuhpazy hnohta bie â taihpa khinarâh ryutotuhpazy châ awpa ta, Khazohpa ta â tlyhpazy châ veih ei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nâmo deikua cha, dyhchhiepa nama mohnao. Châ tlybaipa nata pachiana lâ châ daophituhpazy cha hneirôhpazy châ tyh veih ei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Âmo cha moh zachhihpa nama phaopa a reipachhietuhpazy châ veih ei mâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biehrai ta, “Nâma kyh nâ pachâpa hawhta na vaih kyh na pachâ awpa a châ,” tahpa abeina ryhpa he nama zyh khiahta cha, nama tao pha na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khokhei viapa nama hnei khiahta deikua cha, moleina hmo a taopa châ ei chi ta, hmoparaotuhpa nama châ tahpa ta ryhpa ta thailei a cha pachâsa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahy rai ryhpa zydua zyh paki hra sala, kyh kha a parao khiahta cha, a zydua liata thaileipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Aphei kha,” a tahtuhpa cha, “Liany cheih kha,” a tahtuhpa a châ hra. Chavâta nâ phei leipa chhao ta, liany a cheihpa na châ khiahta cha, ryhpa a paraotuhpa na châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khotalaina ryhpa hmâpa ta ama thâtih pachia awpazy hawhta bie reih u la, hmo tao muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawngiahna a hnei leipa chyhsa cha, pachiana ta ano cha zawh a ngiah hra aw vei. Zawngiahna cha pachiana hlâta a rônah via.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unawh saih u, chyhsa ta, “Ngiapâna ei hnei,” tah sala, hmotaopa a hnei tlôh leipa khiahta cha, khâpa phahnaina a hnei? Cha hawhpa ngiapâna chata ano a pachha thei aw ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unawhpa tlyma, sietanô tlyma, chysia hnei leipa nata noh chareih nie awpa phahlapa ta y sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nama hry liata ahy tlyma ta a hnohta, “Thlalôhpa ta sie la, a lalôhpa ta y la, rihbiepa ta y mah y,” tah sala, pôhpa châta â ngiahpa a pie tlôh leipa khiahta cha, khâpa a phahnai aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, ngiapâna cha hmotaopa hnei leipa ta ano dei ta a y khiahta cha athipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chyhsa ahy tlyma ta, “Nâ ta ngiapâna hnei chi ta, kei ta hmotaopa ei hnei,” a tah thei. Hmotaopa a hlao leipa nâ ngiapâna cha na pahmô tua, kei ta ei ngiapâna cha ei hmotaopa ta ei cha pahmô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khazohpa cha pakha dei a y tahpa a ngiapâ chi ta, a pha na. Ahripazy chhao ta cha cha a ngiapâ ei ta, amâ chalyu tyh mâh tâh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hy chyhsa hrupa y, hmotaopa a hlao leipa ngiapâna cha khâpa hmah châ vei tahpa pahmô awpa na khoh ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miah pathlatuhpa Abarahâ ta a sawchapawpa Aisika maisâh chô liata a hlâ nona kha, hmotaopa vâta thai pachâsapa châ vei mâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Â ngiapâna cha a hmotaopa nata hria khoh ta, ngiapâna cha hmotaopa ta a paki tahpa na hmô.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chatanachata Biehrai ta, “Abarahâ cha Khazohpa a ngiapâ ta, cha ngiapâna cha a siana ta raopa a châ,” a tahpa bie kha vaw tlô ta, Abarahâ cha Khazohpa viasa ta bipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngiapâna vâ dei châ leipa ta, hmotaopa vâta chyhsa ta thai tlao a châ tyh tahpa nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata âzuahnô Rahâbi chhao kha, lyuhchâpazy a vaw ly ta, lâpi hropa lâta a pasiesapa liana khata, hmotaopa vâta thai pachâsapa a châ!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thlahpa a hlao leipa pôhpa cha athipa a châ. Cha hawhna chata hmotaopa a hlao leipa ngiapâna chhao athipa a châ hra.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nama hry liata chyhsa hluhpi la pachutuhpa châ khoh hlei khuh vy. Keimo pachutuhpazy pi cha pachiana a sâh viapa ta pachia awpa eima châpa nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eima zydua ta kyh hluhpi liata eimâ chapia tyh. Chyhsa ta a biereipa liata â chapia beih vei khiahta cha, cha chyhsa cha chyhsa pakipa châ ta, a pôhpa zydua chhao a vaih theipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachâ tua u, eima rei amâ ngiah thei nawpa ta arâ pakah liata chhâri pabaw pi ta, arâ pôhpa zydua eima khona lâ eima pasiesa thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Balyhzy chhao he pachâ tua u, lai ngaita ta, thlih rupa ta a pasiesapa a châ tarawpa ta, haohtuhpa ta pahiehna chyhpata hmâpa ta a khona lâ maih a pasiesa thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata paleih chhao he pôhpa pachiapa chyhpata châ ta, a palai ngaitapa a châ. Meihlih dipa ta râh kawh pi a pakâ theizie chhao pachâ tua u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paleih he mei châ ta, moleina khizaw a châ. Eima pôhpa pachiahpazy hry liata mei tlu ta chichhihpa châ ta, moleina tao awpa ta thatlô ngaitapa a châ. Paleih chata pôhpa zydua papuapalei ta, hro chhôh khihsatôhtuna zydua mei ta pakâ ta, hriena su mei tipo lâ a chhituhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Râhsa chi to, pavaw chi to, alyhpasa chi to nata tilaipi liata hmohrohneipa to he pangâh theipa châ ei ta, chyhsapa ta a pangâh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paleih deikua cha ahy hmah ama pangâh thei leipa châ ta, thina châmaih ta a biepa, moleina a y molo thei leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha paleih chata eima Beipa nata Paw reithai pi ta, cha paleih lilaw chata Khazohpa lyupa ta taopa chyhsazy chô liata chhie eima sa tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pakah miakha tawhta reithaina nata chhiesana a pua tyh. Unawh saih u, cha hmozy cha, cha hawhta a châ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tihnawh miakha tawhta ti pahâhpa nata ti iahpa a papua beih ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unawh saih u, theiku kô liata ôli thei a pathei beih ma? Cha leipa chhao ta, kre zôh liata theiku a pathei thei ma? Cha hawhna chata ti iahpa khaoh ta ti pahâhpa papua thei hra vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nama hry liata ahy ma asopa nata novâhpa a y? A reisi ngaitapa nata so ngaitapa ta, a hmotaopazy cha hrozie phapa ta pamosa mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nama palôh liata hiatlia pasa kawpa nata khohlei khona a hneipa nama châ khiahta deikua cha, nama sona cha a palaikhei leipa u la, biedopa a dyuhpa ta haipa bie reih khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha sona cha chô lâ tawhta a za tlôpa sona châ leipa ta, khizaw sona châ ta, thlahpa tawhta châ leipa ta, ahripa tawhtapa tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiatliana nata khohlei khona a yna lia maihta, tymâna nata paraona pasichhihpa to a y tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chô lâ tawhta sona a za tlôpa deikua cha, a hmiatua ta pathaih ta, thlalôhna ta pazi ta, a nônai ta, hmo yzie pahno thai ta, zawngiahna nata thei phapa ta bie ta, khokhei viapa hnei leipa ta, so piehpiepa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siana thei cha adyryhna taotuhpazy ta adyryhna liata chi ama tupa patheipa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nama hry liata adyuhna nata ahryunazy he khâpa tawhta a pua tyhpa ma a châ? Nama aohraohnazy vâta nama pôhpa pachiahpazy liata adyuhna a tao tyhpa châ vei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khopa hnei ei chi ta, hnei thei tlôh leipa ei chi ta, chavâta liany nama cheih tyh. Uahva ei chi ta, hnei thei tlôh leipa ei chi ta, chavâta a dyuh ei chi ta, namâ hryuh tyh. Nama hia leipa vâta nama hmô leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiah ei chi ta, nama hiapa su leipa ta, nama aohraohna châta hmâ awpa ta nama hiapa vâta, hmô veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nâmo, apheipa saih u, khizaw viasa châpa he Khazohpa nata akhakhaina a châ tahpa pahno veih ei chi ma? Chavâta ahy rai khizaw viasa châ a khohpa maih, Khazohpa khakhaipa ta â tao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biehrai ta, “Keimo liata pahrâ awpa ta a taopa thlahpa cha tlaichhai ta a hiatlia ngaita,” a tahpa he achhuahna y leipa ta a reipa a châ na ta nama pangiasa ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Châhrasala ngiachhiena hluh via ta tlao a vaohei tyh. Chavâta Biehrai ta, “Khazohpa ta apalaipazy a dyuh ta, areisipazy deikua a ngiachhie tyh,” a tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa liata a ngiarih teh u. Ahripa a dyuh u la, a châ râsai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khazohpa a hnia u la, ano chhao a châ hnia aw ei. Nâmo, moleipa saih u, nama kuzy a si u la, palôh a zawvawpa saih u, nama palôhzy pathai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachârôhpa ta y u la, mâchhiesa u la, cha teh u. Nama pahneina cha mâchhiesana lâta a lie sala, namâ lyna chhao hnabeidyna lâta a lie mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa hmiakô liata a panawh u la, Abeipa ta a cha palyupalih aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nâmo nata nâmo a reipachhie khuh vy. Ahy rai unawhpa a reipachhiepa tlyma, unawhpa a seipa tlyma cha, ryhpa a reipachhiepa nata a seipa a châ. Ryhpa na sei khiahta cha, ryhpa a zyhtuhpa châ leipa chi ta, ryhpa a pachiatuhpa tlao na châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ryhpa pietuhpa nata a pachiatuhpa pakha deita a y. Ano cha a pachha theipa nata a pahlei theipa a châ. Na vaih a seituhpa chi cha ahy ma na châ tly?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tahmâ pachâ tua u, nâmo, “Tanoh tlyma, mylâ tlyma, cha khihpi lâ sie aw pi ta, cha liata kô kha y aw pi ta, sôh palie aw pi ta, athôhna eima hmô aw,” a tahtuhpazy saih u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mylâ khâpa hmo ma a y aw tahpa pahno tlôh ei chi va. Nama hrona cha khâpa ma a châ? Tihu buakha a vaw lâ ta, a lei heihpa hawh dei mah nama châ tâh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha hawhta reih leipa u la, “Abeipa ta â ryh a tah khiahta cha, hroh aw pi ta, he hmo he tao aw pi ta, cha hmo cha eima tao aw,” tlao nama tah awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Châhrasala a pasâhsapa ta, a palai ei chi ta, cha hawhpa apalaina zydua cha moleina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta ahy rai hmo pha tao awpa pahno thlâh ha ta, a tao tlôh leipa cha, ano châta moleina a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nâmo, hneirôhpa saih u, a vy u la, nama chô liata rietheina vaw tlô haipazy vâta cha u la, thata sâh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nama hneirônazy hmy ha ta, nama chysiazy chhoma-u ta a chaih khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama ngôh nata tâkâzy a saiie khai ha ta, a saiiepa cha nama thaileizie pahnosana châ aw ta, nama sapa mei hawhta a kâ aw. Noh hnôhchaipazy liata ryu a pachôpa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nathlie tua u, nama lyu rai a hriapazy hlao â doleipa ta nama patâhpazy khata nâmo leihpa ta awh ei ta, hriatuhpazy chana pyu cha, Pheisaihzy Abeipa nakhaoh liata â ngia haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khizaw liana heta sapa palysapa ta phasapa ta hroh ei chi ta, thina noh zy lia taihta nama palôh namâ palysa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chyhsa siapazy thailei pachâsa ei chi ta, châ dyuh leipazy nama thie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta unawh saih u, Abeipa a vy hlâlei palôh pasipa ta y teh u. Pachâ tua u, lyuhneituhpa cha vâsua hmiatuapa nata vâsua hnôh viapa a hmô hlâlei alei thei sôhpa a hâ hualua tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nâmo chhao palôh pasipa ta y u la, Abeipa avyna a hnia ha tlôh ta, chavâta palôh a ipa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unawh saih u, seipa ta nama y lei nawpa ta, nâmo nata nâmo a paphôh thlu khuh vy. Moh tua u, Ryureituhpa cha ochhi thaby liata â duah thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unawh saih u, Abeipa moh ta bie a reihpa hrohsopazy kha, pasataona nata palôh pasina kyh liata a mopâ awpa ta hmâh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachâ teh u, pasataotuhpazy cha nohlaopa tah pi ta, Zawbâ palôh pasizie kha thei ei chi ta, Abeipa hmochhuahpa chhao hmô ei chi ta, Abeipa cha ngiachhietuhpa nata zawngiahtuhpa a châpa nama hmô haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Châhrasala unawh saih u, cha zydua hlâta peimawh chaipa cha, chhiesa lei awpa a châ. Avâ reipa ta tlyma, alei reipa ta tlyma, hmo hropa kheihawhpa reipa ta tlyma, chhiesapa ta bie a taih leipa u la, thailei pachâsapa ta nama y lei nawpa ta, a châpa cha “a châ” tah u la, a châ leipa cha, “châ vei” tah lymâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nama hry liata pasataopa ama y ma? Thlahchhâ mawh sy. Alypa ama y ma? Reithaina hla sa mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nama hry liata tlâhleipa ama y ma? Awnanopa machâzy aw sala, âmo ta Abeipa moh ta sathaw thupa ta, ano châta thlahchhâ mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta thlahchhâna ta tlâhleipa cha pachha aw ta, Abeipa ta ano cha a pathyu aw. Moleina hmo a taopa a châ khiahta cha, a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chavâta patlâhpa ta nama y thei nawpa ta, nama moleinazy reihpha a cheih raihrie u la, thlah a chhâkhei raihrie teh u. Chyhsa siapa thlahchhâna ta hmo rônahpa a tao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elaizâh kha keimo hawhpa nôchâ a phaohpa chyhsapa châ ta, avâ suah lei awpa ta phahnai khoh ngaitapa ta thlahchhâ ta, kô thôh nata thla charu chhôh zydua alei chô liata avâ suah khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatawhcha thlahchhâ heih ta, avâ ta avâ pasuasa ta, alei ta thei a pathei heih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nama hry liata biehmeiseihpa tawhta pavia sala, ahy tlyma ta â vaw chhi heih khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a paviana lâpi tawhta moleipa a chhi pakhuatuhpa cha, thina tawhta a thlahpa a pachhapa châ aw ta, a moleina hluhpi a khupa haw tahpa a pahno mawh sy.
  </para>
</usx>
